{"card":{"cardId":"2NgvS","title":"Harry's Happy Heart","userId":"yoto","slug":"","metadata":{"category":"stories","description":"When Harry is in a very bad mood, his mother says, “Go outside and play, Harry. Being outdoors will make your heart happy!”\nAnd his mother is right. The warm sunshine on Harry’s face feels wonderful, and his tail begins to wag, just a little bit.\nThe fresh air feels so good that Harry decides to take a walk in the park. There, he meets a squirrel trying to dig a hole to bury acorns, a little boy whose sailboat has drifted into the middle of the pond, and a duck with both feet stuck deep in a mud puddle.\nIn each situation, Harry knows just what to do, and he discovers that helping others makes his heart even happier, and his tail wags a little bit more.","minAge":1,"note":"Marketplace","abridged":false,"author":"Old Mrs. Moody Stories","narrators":[],"accents":["US English"],"authors":["Old Mrs. Moody Stories"],"copyrights":["© 2026 SB Veskerna"],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/YoRBbpSTd8CgVsmc4r-Om1hVvdOs2ZMhapkKZpcN0fk"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":2772,"fileSize":33700147},"creators":{"status":"approved"}},"content":{"version":"1","activity":"yoto_Player","config":{"resumeTimeout":2592000,"onlineOnly":false},"availability":"","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/YoRBbpSTd8CgVsmc4r-Om1hVvdOs2ZMhapkKZpcN0fk"},"playbackType":"linear","editSettings":{},"chapters":[{"duration":946,"fileSize":11110630,"key":"00","overlayLabel":"1","title":"Harry's Happy Heart","availableFrom":null,"ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/KCaNYHR14IvwyOY7SymTVUv6QmU28u2QUepBstE64cQ"},"tracks":[{"channels":"stereo","duration":946,"fileSize":11110630,"format":"opus","key":"abRUU6h0dJ","overlayLabel":"1","title":"Harry's Happy Heart","type":"audio","ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/KCaNYHR14IvwyOY7SymTVUv6QmU28u2QUe